{"seq":11,"trial_id":"company-brain-2026-10/qm-pi-haiku-company-scoped-mu-heldout/si-03-saltmarsh-discount/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-24T23:55:54.381Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"295aef35067967f42c0fc9f8eb09751fb6dd0f8dc46c225aa4ee9c9984ede728","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","text":"Sofia, the discount is **10%**, and it's the figure Bettina gave in the channel once she corrected herself.\n\n- **Source:** Amendment 1, signed by Corinne Ashdown and June Osei-Lark on 2025-10-20, sets a 10% retention discount on per-seat charges, effective 2025-11-01.\n- **Carried forward:** The 2026 Renewal Order Form (signed 2026-06-18, effective 2026-07-01) says the existing 10% discount carries over unchanged.\n- **The 12% figure:** Bettina posted 12% on Nov 17, then retracted it minutes later and said it's 10%. Use 10%.\n\nThe original 2025 order form showed 7%, but Amendment 1 superseded that."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1253QW9NJ6","ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
